  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Nana has an older sister.",
      "offset": 1000,
      "duration": 5960,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "They are both about the same age.",
      "offset": 6960,
      "duration": 4880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Her] older sister is 16 years old.",
      "offset": 11840,
      "duration": 4040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nana is 15 years old.",
      "offset": 15880,
      "duration": 4640,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "They look similarly beautiful.",
      "offset": 20520,
      "duration": 7280,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Both have a pair of big eyes,",
      "offset": 27800,
      "duration": 6160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "and hair about the same length.",
      "offset": 33960,
      "duration": 6060,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Their heights are also similar.",
      "offset": 40020,
      "duration": 5980,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Her] older sister is 1,65 m.",
      "offset": 46000,
      "duration": 4420,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nana is 1,62 m.",
      "offset": 50420,
      "duration": 4720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "They both attend middle school",
      "offset": 55140,
      "duration": 4700,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "and study at the same school.",
      "offset": 59840,
      "duration": 5400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Their] grades are similarly good.",
      "offset": 65240,
      "duration": 6280,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although they look similar,",
      "offset": 71520,
      "duration": 6260,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[but] their personalities are quite different.",
      "offset": 77780,
      "duration": 5640,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nana loves to talk and laugh;",
      "offset": 83420,
      "duration": 5960,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "she likes to be with friends.",
      "offset": 89380,
      "duration": 6000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Her] older sister does not like to talk;",
      "offset": 95380,
      "duration": 4700,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "she prefers to be alone.",
      "offset": 100080,
      "duration": 6140,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mom loves Nana very much.",
      "offset": 106220,
      "duration": 4060,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "She also loves [Nana's] older sister very much.",
      "offset": 110280,
      "duration": 3720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her love towards [her] two girls is the same.",
      "offset": 114000,
      "duration": 7420,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mom is about 50 years old,",
      "offset": 121420,
      "duration": 5920,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "but she looks about 40 years old.",
      "offset": 127340,
      "duration": 8520,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mom and dad's birthdays are about the same day.",
      "offset": 135860,
      "duration": 8740,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mom's birthday is on May 5th.",
      "offset": 144600,
      "duration": 6780,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dad's birthday is on May 6th.",
      "offset": 151380,
      "duration": 6800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Every year",
      "offset": 158180,
      "duration": 1720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "they celebrate their birthdays together.",
      "offset": 159900,
      "duration": 5220,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mom's birthday wish is similar every year.",
      "offset": 165120,
      "duration": 7320,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "She wishes",
      "offset": 172440,
      "duration": 2060,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "for her daughters to be healthy and merry.",
      "offset": 174500,
      "duration": 6440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Every year, Dad's birthday wish",
      "offset": 180940,
      "duration": 4060,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "is almost the same, too.",
      "offset": 185000,
      "duration": 4420,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "He wishes for the whole family",
      "offset": 189420,
      "duration": 3880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "to be joyous and happy forever.",
      "offset": 193300,
      "duration": 5200,
      "lang": "en"
    }
  ]
}